# LIMPET: the station opens up as decks are cleared. Gus's crate gives way at
# four (the canteen), two more obstacles at nine (the Gristle wing's doors
# and the canteen's back room); a dead end in the wing is a false wall with
# a pod behind it; the Turncoat's pod is up a side way of plates in the
# wing's ceiling; scrapping it opens the shaft to the upper ring, where a pod
# hides at the end of a slot only a warp from the far wall reaches, and
# another under a floor; the Dreadnought's wall opens at 22 decks; a bridge
# of honey to the secret deck appears with all 24 jars. (Reach: the demo
# player's map search.)
